      "summaries": {
        "en": "FadCam is an open-source Android multimedia recorder that eliminates ads while offering background video recording, screen recording, live streaming, and remote camera control. It leverages Camera2 API and CameraX for efficient camera access and uses FFmpeg for video processing. Technically, it decouples recording from the UI, enabling background operation without foreground service restrictions. Developers can integrate it into apps needing reliable, ad-free recording or extend it for custom streaming solutions.",
        "zh": "FadCam 是一款开源、无广告的 Android 多媒体录制器，支持后台视频录制、屏幕录制、直播推流和远程摄像头控制。它利用 Camera2 API 和 CameraX 实现高效的相机访问，并通过 FFmpeg 进行视频处理。其技术亮点在于将录制与 UI 解耦，使得应用即使在前台服务受限的情况下也能在后台持续录制，这通过分离录制线程和生命周期管理实现。开发者可以将其集成到需要稳定、无广告录制功能的应用中，例如监控、直播或教育工具，也可基于其模块化架构扩展自定义推流协议或滤镜效果。",
        "es": "FadCam is an open-source Android multimedia recorder that eliminates ads while offering background video recording, screen recording, live streaming, and remote camera control. It leverages Camera2 API and CameraX for efficient camera access and uses FFmpeg for video processing. Technically, it decouples recording from the UI, enabling background operation without foreground service restrictions. Developers can integrate it into apps needing reliable, ad-free recording or extend it for custom streaming solutions.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "FadCam stands out for android-app, android-studio, and cam in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "FadCam is an open-source Android multimedia recorder that eliminates ads while offering background video recording, screen recording, live streaming, and remote camera control. It leverages Camera2 API and CameraX for efficient camera access and uses FFmpeg for video processing. Technically, it decouples recording from the UI, enabling background operation without foreground service restrictions. Developers can integrate it into apps needing reliable, ad-free recording or extend it for custom streaming solutions.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/anonfaded/FadCam for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
